WEBVTT

00:49:56.586 --> 00:50:00.675
And also don't relate
to a human connection

00:50:00.699 --> 00:50:02.657
and empathy and compassion.

00:50:02.681 --> 00:50:04.896
CA: And then you have
another category of jobs,

00:50:04.920 --> 00:50:06.071
which are more creative,

00:50:06.095 --> 00:50:09.153
not necessarily more social
or empathetic than those,

00:50:09.177 --> 00:50:10.353
but are more creative,

00:50:10.377 --> 00:50:11.979
that you describe, "Slow Creep,"

00:50:12.003 --> 00:50:16.258
there may be a solid future
that AI will gradually intrude on them.

00:50:16.282 --> 00:50:18.706
Things like being certain kinds of artists

00:50:18.730 --> 00:50:21.164
or scientists or graphic designers.

00:50:21.188 --> 00:50:23.129
What else would you put in that category

00:50:23.153 --> 00:50:26.926
of "maybe OK for a bit, but look out
and be ready to retrain?"

00:50:26.950 --> 00:50:31.648
KFL: Yeah, I think graphic artist
is a good example.